w: 1.~Save me, O God, by thy great name, and judge me by thy strength:
w: 2.~For they that stran- gers are to me do up a- gainst me rise;
w: 3.~The Lord my God my help- er is, lo, there- fore I am bold:
w: 4.~Un- to mine e- ne- mies he shall mis- chief and ill re- pay:
w: 5.~I will a sac- ri- fice to thee give with free wil- ling- ness;
w: 6.~Fo- r he hath me de- liv- ered from all ad- ver- si- ties;
